            "review_title": "Review at Anrakutei Japanese BBQ - Nguyen Trai",
            "review_text": "TravelingFoodie\nMiami, Florida10725 contributions\n0\nPretty good\nDec 2025 • Friends\nWe had a good lunch at Anrakutei Japanese BBQ in Saigon. The restaurant is clean, comfortable and well organised, making it a pleasant place for a relaxed meal. The meat quality was good, nicely prepared and easy to grill, with sauces that worked well with the flavours. Service was attentive and efficient throughout. Overall, a solid and reliable option for Japanese BBQ, especially for lunch.\nRead more\nWritten January 6, 2026",
