            "review_text": "Hoang Vo\nDa Nang, Vietnam394 contributions\n0\nJust okay\nMar 2022 • Family\n5 people and a child but only 1 oven. Very slow to grill, wasting time for waiting. Staff is nice, but lack of focus near closing time. Food is not various, so not eating a lot. Matcha ice cream is good. Beverage is not included. Just okay, not premium like I expected. And seats on the floor so it's very annoying when kids of other tables run and jump.\nWritten March 27, 2022",
